<title>USA: USDA - soybean sales to China 52,500 MT Jul 10 wk.  [CORRECTED 13:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>USDA - soybean sales to China 52,500 MT Jul 10 wk.  [CORRECTED 13:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline to July 10 week from June 10 week.)</p>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department said on Thursday in its weekly export sales report that net soybean sales to China for delivery during the 1997/98 marketing year totalled 52,500 tonnes in the week to July 10.</p>
<p>The report is prepared from information submitted by private exporters to USDA.</p>
</text>
